# MySQL test suite — cmake installs the full mtr framework, test
# files, helper scripts, and sanitizer suppressions under
# usr/lib/mysql-test/. PXC ships only mysqlxtest from the test
# package (see percona-xtradb-cluster-test.install); the rest of the
# tree (~5000 .test/.result/.inc files plus mtr.pl, suite/, include/,
# std_data/, lib/, plus tsan.supp / valgrind.supp) is not packaged.
# release-9.6.0 silently dropped these at compat 9; at compat 13
# dh_missing requires the explicit exclude.
usr/lib/mysql-test/*

# daemon_example.ini — sample config for the daemon_example plugin
